    LLM: 'Push only when the offered card is weak and the cost is worth the chance of a better card; otherwise accept and save chips for betting.\n\nTrack which upcards opponents have; push more often when you need to avoid pairing low or when the next card could complete a draw.\n\nBalance push cost against pot odds; use position to push selectively so the next player gets a card you know is bad for their board.',
